        <section class="section">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-12 col-lg-6 order-2 order-lg-1">
                <div class="section-body">
                  <div class="section-title overflow-hidden">
                    <h1 class="wow anim--slideUp">About Us</h1>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section-content content-maxw overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="wow anim--slideUp">
                      <p>XRC is the only x-ray baggage screening system manufacturer in Turkey, and we are one of only a handful of manufacturers in the entire world who produces x-ray security systems that are approved by TSA and ECAC. More recently, in response to the Covid-19 pandemic, we have developed UV-C baggage surface cleaning systems that deactivate 99.9997% of Sars-CoV-2 and other viruses and bacteria on the surface of baggage, parcels and other packages.  Integrity is at the heart of everything we do and is the basic principle that guides our R&D, our commitment to quality, our after-sales maintenance and service, and how we treat our customers, our suppliers and our employees.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <!--div class="section-footer overflow-hidden">
                    <a href="/en/corporate" id="ContentPlaceHolder1_ahakkimizda" class="section-router router-w-icon wow anim--slideUp" style="padding: .625rem 0">
                      <span>About X-Ray Center</span>
                      <i data-feather="arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                  </div-->
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-lg-6 mb-5 mb-lg-0 order-1 order-lg-2 overflow-hidden">
                <div class="company-information overflow-hidden wow anim--slideUp">
                  <div class="information-grid overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="experience wow anim--slideUp">
                      <div class="flex-wrapper fw-row fw-a-center fw-j-sb">
                        <div class="experience-value">
                          <div class="flex-wrapper fw-column">
                            <div class="experience-count">
                              <span id="ContentPlaceHolder1_divrakam1" class="counter experience-counter" data-count="20">20</span>
                              <span class="sign">+</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="experience-text">Years Experience</div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="experience-details">
                          <p>Founded in 1998, XRC has grown into a global brand known for its quality, reliability, flexibility and sustainability.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="productModels wow anim--slideUp">
                      <div class="flex-wrapper fw-column">
