                          <div class="news-info">
                            <div class="news-title">Smuggled Cigarettes Were Seized at Istanbul Atatürk Airport</div>
                            <div class="news-details">
                              <p>10 thousand packs of smuggled cigarettes were seized at Istanbul Ataturk Airport, in the luggage of 7 passengers. As a result of the inspection of the 12 suitcases by the security team with the X-Ray control device, 10 thousand packs of smuggled cigarettes with a market value of 100.000 turkish lira were found. As a result, the suspects were taken into custody. X-Ray Center security products continue to work in the fight against smuggling and remain proud of their achievements.</p>
